  <item>
    <title>Vol.28 八月，我们正在学会彼此照料｜Good News</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a96181ba0210c197dcb4db6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a96181ba0210c197dcb4db6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:15:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp0x1Dk5X7LANAI7gLkbyDAe9Aqh.png"><p></p><p><span>哈喽朋友们，欢迎收听新一期的节目！本期内容依旧是每月固定栏目——Good News</span></p><p><span>前几天刷到一条万转的推，看完一下子感慨：美丽可爱的地球哇！瞬间觉得自己的烦恼只是庞大世界的小小一部分，也希望分享的这些好消息能够给大家带来一些善意和力量。</span></p><p><span>那条推文是这样说的：</span></p><blockquote><p><span>我们生活在一个章鱼会做梦的世界，水獭有一块它们终生携带的最喜欢的贝壳，奶牛有最好的朋友，蜜蜂根据地区有不同的“方言”舞蹈。猫咪的呼噜声能加速骨骼愈合，森林在火灾后首先长出花朵，海豚彼此取名字并回应这些名字，企鹅通过赠送彼此最美丽的鹅卵石来求婚。</span></p></blockquote><p></p><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 共建性别包容职场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 镜头有了底线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">03:51</a> 经期用品纳入医保</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 更灵活的短期育儿假</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 实操技能点亮前路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 女足闯进世界杯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 她们正在照料整个世界</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgP0_pX2jfLZlRJsVKIgsnfTPChY.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a> 小狗等待新家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="907">15:07</a> 为飞鸟贴上安全波点</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_df8v4cnlqC2X2-Dwa54yvlcqw.JPG"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a> 小猫入职记</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiKttb3ATLsX7IjkgROIDgnhngI.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-HYLafEowtZEUgLKY1cf3unfkK.JPG"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a> 健身房里的挂念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 谢谢你的招待</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoSMNcLhFJY10xE1zn3SaKfclfQL.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 和父母一起过暑假</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期涉及歌曲】：高敏慧 - 一窗清响</span></p><p><span>【声音】：66</span></p><p><span>【剪辑】：66</span></p><p><span>【音频平台】</span></p><p><span>苹果播客、网易云音乐、Spotify、Substack</span></p><p><span>也欢迎关注微信公众号「夜间飞行志」获取更多往期内容</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
