  <item>
    <title>Vol.26 七月，胜负之外自成旷野｜Good News</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6c8f8856a3f3491ba82080</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6c8f8856a3f3491ba82080</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 12:22:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFrAxrG9wavVXu9Wqm3PZOr3prQ.JPG"><p></p><p><span>哈喽朋友们重磅消息，本J人经过深思熟虑，决定固定下来每月更新频率，一个月两次，月中更新一期书影音，月末还是固定好消息栏目，其它内容可能随机掉落更新。</span></p><p><span>那么，请接收7月好消息。本期Good News的主题是「不以胜负定终局，做完整而有选择的自己」</span></p><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 胜负之外</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 孙颖莎获美国大满贯冠军</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 逆风翻盘</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fot31AIS_C2LXys0rnXSyC6XKVnz.JPG"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> 王的猜想</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJcny4a8d45UtDVhWWywizDvdld.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 写给毕业生的话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 善意推倒隐形的墙</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj3K4XGDhqAqeOWE3D8OYDJIrRlA.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9IcYSHeMFDaw4kgnY2ZR8HVzKw.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> 疼痛被认真对待</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 暴雨夜的两位女性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 打开更多扇门</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 生活会突然变好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">20:52</a> 再见，老朋友</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuKu0mo7pkY7YdgSGtI9iL3EKsJh.jpg"><p></p><p><span>🌟Highlights</span></p><ul><li><p><span>在这个习惯用“结果”定义成败、用“效率”衡量价值的时代，我们难免会被某种紧绷感和焦虑感推着往前走。</span></p></li><li><p><span>一个人的价值，也绝不仅仅由最后的结果来证明。</span></p></li><li><p><span>留出一片不被外包的领地，让那里生长着你的判断、你的疑问、你的愤怒、你的悲悯，和那些不合时宜的坚持。</span></p></li><li><p><span>我不能祝你一帆风顺，因为我们都知道那太难了，一帆风顺像一句轻飘飘的假话。我只能教给你最笨的方式，教你怎么感受世界，怎么保全自己。尽量坚持得久一些，珍惜自己身上那些美好的品质，尽管一路上有很多人告诉你它没有用。</span></p></li></ul><p><span>【本期涉及歌曲】：</span></p><p><span>西村由纪江 - ビタミン（维生素）</span></p><p><span>【剪辑】：66</span></p><p><span>【声音】：66</span></p><p><span>【音频平台】：</span></p><p><span>苹果播客、网易云音乐、Spotify、Substack</span></p><p><span>也欢迎关注微信公众号夜间飞行志获取更多往期内容（</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fboyTPKWf2f3EMi9n5dc_A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fboyTPKWf2f3EMi9n5dc_A"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a><span>）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/630e0d4f90075df00b6f85f3/ltPWng9fUOGMhk9si4aCjPUktpuI.m4a" length="22921645" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghTR1bqT__2PsZPujt2HyOusqA9.JPG"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.25 六月，四面八方都是前方｜Good News</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a45c11a9d2f5743684128f2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a45c11a9d2f5743684128f2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 01:40:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFrAxrG9wavVXu9Wqm3PZOr3prQ.JPG"><p></p><p><span>嗨朋友们，7月的第二天，我想分享一些6月的好消息作为开始，本期「Good News」的主题是：解绑旧剧本，书写新坐标。</span></p><p><span>望收到这些好消息的你，能够顺利开启七月。</span></p><p><span>祝你7月将充满爱，7月将充满宁静，7月将充满治愈，7月将充满进步，7月将充满祝福，7月将充满幸福，7月将充满机遇</span></p><p></p><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 做一只冬眠的熊，在低谷中安静蓄力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 四面八方，都是前方</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 接纳上天赐予的荒野，去磨砺成高飞的鹰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 14年前的支教影像</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke26O1pBt-V7H3M0-2E2Xjjdwqz.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 滴滴上线女性友好计划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> 丹麦新内阁女性成员过半</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 公平的赛道逐渐出现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 传统性别分工的悄然松动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a> 金融领域女性赋权的回响</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXuSRvsn5Ob_nD_qjHQkRoF9-aj.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 印度反女性割礼运动的十年</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 她们被世界看见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 妈妈，时代变了</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsZdgYMbybHVxad1CuvGCuAoKWsB.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> 还原历史的真貌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 漫游无垠星空</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnv0CKA7DTEhx5gTy_L3osGUtCYb.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 小行星「徐熙媛」</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSM99bJBABftsG0a2alBxcqFA9S.jpg"><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 万物自如的生命律动</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr5eZIPQ-DVogdTlbKuhRIT3Jhvp.jpg"><p></p><p><span>🌟Highlights</span></p><ul><li><p><span>安静地等待。好好睡觉，像一只冬眠的熊。锻炼身体，坚信无论是承受更深的低潮或是迎接高潮，好的体魄都用得着。和知心的朋友谈天</span></p></li><li><p><span>不要觉得这一次就会决定什么，未来的路只会更自由更快乐。你只管勇敢的走，别回头。因为四面八方，都是前方</span></p></li><li><p><span>当上天赐给你荒野时，意味着，它要你成为高飞的鹰。</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>【本期涉及歌曲】：Steve Erquiaga - Themes from Cinema Paradiso: First Youth/Love Theme for Nata</span></p><p><span>【剪辑】：66</span></p><p><span>【声音】：66</span></p><p><span>【音频平台】</span></p><p><span>苹果播客、网易云音乐、Spotify、Substack</span></p><p><span>也欢迎关注微信公众号夜间飞行志获取更多往期内容（</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RLq-HNQr8x__eTJGy33Nuw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RLq-HNQr8x__eTJGy33Nuw"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a><span>）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/630e0d4f90075df00b6f85f3/lgtVXeyL5Fj2bf_VP_Zo9BIiBJhP.m4a" length="16635441" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:08</itunes:duration>
