  <item>
    <title>Vol.16《甜蜜蜜》：失败的爱情总比成功的爱情多</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699ae2eca22480add6b37e5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699ae2eca22480add6b37e5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Feb 2026 11:10:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽朋友们，今天想和大家分享一部电影——《甜蜜蜜》。之所以选择它，是因为即便已经过去30年，这部影片中所展现的爱情依然在当下有着现实意义。它让我们开始思考，在高度不确定中，爱情如何发生又如何被现实慢慢改写。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 关于爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 《甜蜜蜜》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 编剧岸西与片名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 李翘与黎小军之间是爱情吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 李翘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">18:51</a> 豹哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">23:52</a> 黎小军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 很喜欢的三个镜头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 古典爱情与现代爱情的叙事差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期涉及歌曲】：邓丽君 — 甜蜜蜜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】：六六不爱练琴</span></p><span></span><p><span>【声音】：六六不爱练琴</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号夜间飞行志已更新长文，苹果播客同步更新</span></p>]]></description>
